    "sub_ename": "PROGRAMMING LANGUAGE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程在探討C語言程式設計的概念與實作，包括文法結構和語意、設計及實作問題，並訓練學生具備解決問題及邏輯思考的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces to students the concept of C languages, including syntax structure and semantics, design and implementation issues. We also provide student training to possess problem-solving ability and logical thinking.",
